// IntroString :
"P3894200497" "I hope you already had your good day, {HeroName} 'cause I am about to make it a lot worse. I was told to get word to you that the Council is planning to kidnap {POLITICIAN_NAME} and his entire staff. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You need you to get to the campaign headquarters right away to save {POLITICIAN_NAME} and his staff</A>. Time is of the essence. You'll only have 90 minutes to save those people."
// AcceptString :
"P3169346770" "Protect {POLITICIAN_NAME} from Council agents"
// SendOffString :
"P2344530950" "The clock is ticking on this one, so listen carefully. The Council will be after not just {POLITICIAN_NAME}, but all of his staff and volunteer workers. You'll have to rescue all of them before the Council can kidnap them. Saving those hostages isn't the end of it though; you'll also need to defeat the Penumbra operative in charge of the operation, along with his command group. Otherwise, those people will never be safe."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P70932947" "Stop {BOSS_NAME}, his crew"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P770187357" "You MUST protect {POLITICIAN_NAME} from the Council."

