// Dialog :
"P1199195045" "{POLITICIAN_NAME} wanted to thank you personally for rescuing him, but the Secret Service are worried about another attempt on his life and they don't want him to make another appearance for a bit. I can understand their caution. The Council has been known to brainwash politicians before, then sit back like a bunch of sick puppeteers, pulling their strings. It's a good thing you stopped them today, {HeroName}."
// RandomFameString :
"P646104484" "I wish I could vote for {HeroName} instead of {POLITICIAN_NAME}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1194677554" "I know that I can't expect you to win them all, {HeroName}. But I was hoping, really hoping. The fall-out from this could shake up a lot of the political landscape. The Council has been known to brainwash politicians before, then sit back like a bunch of sick puppeteers, pulling their strings."
// RandomFameString :
"P1956962182" "{POLITICIAN_NAME}'s views sure have changed lately."

