// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ScienceTeamStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2212930501" "Science Team Story"
// DetailString :
"P2928010794" "Upon his rescue, Dr. Boyd told you: 'The Council was interested in two specific pieces of Rikti Technology that we call the Manifold Resonator and Resonance Disruptor. Their full functions aren't known, but research on them could revolutionize several key areas of physics. They're also looking for reports we were preparing on a recent autopsy of a Rikti soldier and an overview of Rikti technology that we prepared for congress."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ManifoldResonator 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4119686102" "Manifold Resonator"
// DetailString :
"P3822518867" "This piece of Rikti Technology was used in Rikti portals to maintain field stability through the travel process. It has been modified to allow a single person to teleport a short distance a limited number of times, but has a slight side effect on use."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ResonanceDisrupter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1029235096" "Resonance Disruptor"
// DetailString :
"P682229852" "This piece of modified Rikti Technology came from a piece of a Rikti portal and can make the user out-of-phase with reality for a short time, at great cost to the user's health."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RiktiResearch 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P34511051" "Files A7-990 to LV-426"
// DetailString :
"P4270388495" "These files constitute sections of a report meant for congress on the world's current understanding of Rikti technology. Though much of it is encrypted, you note certain frequently mentioned elements, such as the Rikti's mastery of force fields. You also see that the report mentions that the Rikti apparently have no practical knowledge of nuclear power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RiktiAutopsyReport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1717048320" "File 77-276"
// DetailString :
"P980240759" "This file details the autopsy of a Rikti soldier. Much of the file has been encrypted by powerful ciphers, including nearly all of the anatomical photographs."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2480536115" "Exarch Labs just reported a break-in by Council agents. Their vaults contain several Rikti weapons and other pieces of alien technology left over from the Rikti War, none of which can be allowed to fall into enemy hands. It gets even better, though, because the Sky Raiders know about the theft, and might make a play for the same prize in the confusion. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>It's going to take heroic action to stop the theft of Rikti technology.</A> Once this is started you'll have to hurry. You only have 90 minutes to stop the break-in."
// AcceptString :
"P2367313717" "Stop the Council from stealing Rikti Technology"
// SendOffString :
"P2611013828" "That Rikti stuff is probably the most dangerous technology on the planet. Hurry, {HeroName}!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P124972733" "Stop raid leaders & their crews"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1213338687" "The Council operates on a tight time schedule. So you better get over there and stop them!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3891069227" "A smell of gun powder hangs in the air. You can only hope the Council hasn't hurt anyone."

