"P1302313110" "You have opened the safe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P192332986" "You have recovered the research, and shut down the project."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2911518139" "Great job shutting down project Hercules. I've been worried about the Council's advances in Cor Leonis research, but you've headed their research off for a while. Maybe Dr. {BOSS_NAME} and Professor {BOSS_NAME2} end up sharing a cell, they'll have something to talk about. <br><br>Actually, I think I'm going to call a friend at the Brick House to make sure those two are in separate cell blocks. Just in case."
// RandomFameString :
"P2948209161" "I heard {HeroName} took on a whole battalion of Council agents and won!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_Council_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3710159933" "The Council has been stepping up activity recently. They've been recruiting, training, and performing terror operations all over the city. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>These Council operations need to be stopped wherever they occur, and their soldiers defeated at every turn.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2524684" "Hit the streets to defeat Council soldiers"
// SendOffString :
"P4246677056" "Council agents have been seen in Independence Port recently, making deals or muscling in on the gangs in the area. I'm sure your efforts there would be worth it. However, many zones of the city have seen an increase in Council activity, and I'm sure your efforts would be appreciated anywhere."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2676473982" "Combat Council menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P503209500" "You'll need to defeat more Council agents to slow down their operations."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3612472731" "You have defeated out enough Council agents."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1777098352" "My informants tell me that the Council's high command put several major projects on hold after you started hitting their agents. Good work, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_Council_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2751744264" "Dock masters in Independence Port have reported seeing Council soldiers fighting with the crime syndicates in the area. If the Council could take control of Independence Port, they might get a dangerous strategic advantage in their operations throughout the city. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The Council needs to be taught that they'll never control Independence Port.</A> You'll need to hit the streets to teach them the only way they'll learn."
// AcceptString :
"P1152976149" "Defeat Council in Independence Port"
// SendOffString :
"P1926601581" "The Council has been seen around Industry Pier and Liberty Quay, but I'm sure your help would be appreciated anywhere in the zone."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2306925908" "Keep peace in Independence Port"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1871509820" "You need to defeat more Council agents in Independence Port."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3928297465" "You have defeated enough Council agents."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1106716856" "Word is that the Council is reconsidering their strategy thanks to your efforts in Independence Port. Good work."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_Council_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1753714170" "The Council's presence in Independence Port is becoming great enough to destabilize the whole area. If something isn't done soon, it could precipitate a gang war. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The best way to relieve the situation is for the city's heroes to crack down on the Council in Independence Port.</a> They need a taste of what a war on the streets would be like."
// SendOffString :
"P3301676368" "A number of Council troops have been seen in the Patriot Wharf area and around Justice Quay, so you might want to start your search there. You don't have to limit yourself to just those areas, though."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4275741299" "You'll need to defeat more Council agents to ease tensions in the area."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P238324008" "You have defeated enough Council troops to ease tensions in Independence Port."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1420318647" "The Council is a threat to the whole city, {HeroName}. It's good that the people of Paragon can count on you to keep their militant cabal in line."

