// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P390269509" "I hope you already had your good day, {HeroName} 'cause I am about to make it a lot worse. I was told to get word to you that the Council is planning to kidnap {POLITICIAN_NAME} and his entire staff. {LAST_NAME} is giving a speech in Jannissey Heights today, and I'll bet good money the Council plans to strike there. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You need you to get to Jannissey Heights right away to save {POLITICIAN_NAME}.</A> You'll only have 90 minutes to save those people."
// SendOffString :
"P3761497847" "The clock is ticking on this one, so listen carefully. The Council will be after not just {POLITICIAN_NAME}, but all of his staff. You'll have to rescue every last volunteer. Saving them isn't the end of it though; you'll also need to defeat {BOSS_NAME}, the operative in charge of the assassination. Otherwise, those people will never be safe."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1371499163" "Stop {BOSS_NAME} & his crew"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2812151905" "You must protect {POLITICIAN_NAME} from the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P3870664794" "Jannissey Heights"
// EntryString :
"P4271823828" "Two dead security guards are a sure sign that the Council is already in the area."

