"P877235772" "They said there were going to kidnap us all! I'm just an intern!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P865064726" "{POLITICIAN_NAME} wanted to thank you for rescuing him, but the Secret Service wouldn't let him come in person. I can understand their caution. The Council has been known to brainwash politicians, then sit back like a bunch of sick puppet masters pulling their strings. It's a good thing you stopped them today, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1774804969" "I know that I can't expect you to win them all, {HeroName}. But I was hoping, really hoping. The fall-out from this could shake up a lot of the political landscape. The Council has been known to brainwash politicians, then sit back like a bunch of sick puppet masters pulling their strings. If {POLITICIAN_NAME} resurfaces, I'm afraid we'll have to keep our eyes on him."
// RandomFameString :
"P4181277509" "{POLITICIAN_NAME}'s views have certainly changed lately."
